# .understandignore — patterns excluded from /understand analysis
# Scope decision (user-confirmed 2026-09-16): analyze ONLY src/threat_report_agent.
# The rest of the repository (tests/, docs/, release-artifacts/, threat-dsh-workbench/,
# scripts/, .scratch/, node_modules/) is excluded by the whitelist below.
#
# Whitelist form: ignore everything, then re-include the src/ chain.
# Gitignore requires every parent directory of a re-included path to be
# re-included as well, hence the explicit three lines.

*
!src/
!src/threat_report_agent/
!src/threat_report_agent/**

# Within the scope, still drop caches and build byproducts (also covered by
# the built-in defaults, listed here for visibility).
src/threat_report_agent/__pycache__/
src/threat_report_agent/**/*.pyc
